    <data key="d0">Pinterest Fine-Grained S3 Data Access Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Pinterest uses a custom Token Vending Service integrated with LDAP and AWS STS session policies to dynamically grant fine-grained S3 bucket access to EC2-based data processing clusters.</data>
